  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN289.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">pirintu pōkāniṉṟa talaimakaṉ ṟaṉṉeñciṟkuc colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What HE who was going after having parted [from her] said to his heart.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN289.1">
        <l>cilaiyē raṭṭa kaṇai<supplied>vī</supplied>ḻ vampala</l>
        <l>ruyarpatuk kiva<supplied>r</supplied>nta tatarkoṭi yatira</l>
        <l>ṉeṭunilai naṭuka ṉāṭpalik kūṭṭuñ</l>
        <l>curaṉiṭai vilaṅki maraṉōṅ kiyaviṉ</l>
        <l>vantuviṉai valitta namvayi ṉeṉṟun</l>
        <l><supplied>teru</supplied>mara luḷḷamoṭu varunta lāṉātu</l>
        <l>nekiḻā meṉpiṇi vīṅkiya kaiciṟi</l>
        <l>taviḻiṉu muyavu māymaṭat takuvi</l>
        <l>cēṇuṟai <supplied>pu</supplied>lampi ṉāṇmuṟai yiḻaitta</l>
        <l>tiṇcuvar nōkki niṉaintu kaṇpaṉi</l>
        <l>nekiḻnūṉ muttiṉ mukiḻmulait teṟippa</l>
        <l>maiyaṟa virinta paṭaiyamai cēkkai</l>
        <l>yaimmeṉ ṟūvi yaṇaicēr pacaii</l>
        <l>maiyal koṇṭa mataṉaḻi yirukkaiyaḷ</l>
        <l>pakuvāyp palli paṭutoṟum paravi</l>
        <l>nalla kūṟeṉa naṭuṅkip</l>
        <l>pulleṉ mālaiyoṭu poruṅko ṟāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="5">Always on account of us who are forced by work, coming [back]</l>
        <l corresp="4">by ways where trees are high, blocking [the way] in the middle of the desert,</l>
        <l corresp="3d+2">where they join wild jasmine in broken creepers that climbed over the high stone heaps</l>
        <l corresp="1">for travellers fallen by arrows that killed when rising from the bows,</l>
        <l corresp="3a-c">to the daily offering on the tall-standing hero stones,</l>
        <l corresp="6">unending in suffering, with a perturbed heart,</l>
        <l corresp="8">the choice innocent [girl] who is suited [to us] who suffers even if [our] hands</l>
        <l corresp="7">that were tight [just] open a little the soft grip [on her] that does not become loose,</l>
        <l>in loneliness, as [we] stay in the distance, looking at the solid wall</l>
        <l corresp="9f">where she marked the rows of days, thinking, while tears</l>
        <l corresp="11">seep onto [her] budding breasts like pearls from a loose thread,</l>
        <l corresp="13">resting on the mattress of wonderfully soft feathers</l>
        <l corresp="12">on the bed suited for sleeping that has been spread out without a speck,</l>
        <l corresp="14">she on a seat, [her] strength perishing that is taken over by madness,</l>
        <l corresp="15">reverent each time the split-mouthed gecko calls,</l>
        <l corresp="16">shivering with [the words] “tell [me] good [news]!”,</l>
        <l corresp="17">does she fight with bleak evening?</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

